1 FETCH_OBJ_R: ~a a after |
2 FETCH_DIM_R: ~b b after |
3 ISSET_ISEMPTY_PROP_OBJ: ~c set after |
4 ISSET_ISEMPTY_DIM_OBJ: ~d set after |
5 INIT_METHOD_CALL: ~e e after |
6 INIT_DYNAMIC_CALL: ~f inv after |
7 INIT_STATIC_METHOD_CALL: ~g sm after |
8 SEND_VAL: in ~h after |
9 SEND_VAR_NO_REF: in ~i after |
10 SEND_USER: in ~j after |
11 SEND_UNPACK: in ~k after |
12 SEND_ARRAY: in ~l after |
13 ASSIGN (TMP): set ~m after |
14 ASSIGN_OBJ (OP_DATA): set ~n after ~n0 |
15 ASSIGN_DIM (OP_DATA): set ~o after |
16 ASSIGN_OP (.=): ~p xsp after |
17 QM_ASSIGN: set ~q after |
18 JMP_SET (?:): ~r r after |
19 COALESCE: ~s null after |
20 JMPZ: ~t body after |
21 JMPNZ_EX (||): ~u y after |
22 JMPZ_EX (&&): ~v y after |
23 BOOL: ~w y after |
24 BOOL_NOT: ~x n after |
25 CAST (array): ~y 3 after |
26 CAST (string): ~z sz after |
27 TYPE_CHECK: ~aa y after |
28 INSTANCEOF: ~ab y after |
29 IS_IDENTICAL: ~ac n after |
30 IS_EQUAL: ~ad ~ad2 n after |
31 CONCAT: ~ae saex after |
32 ROPE: ~af o<saf>o after |
33 ECHO: sag~ag  after |
34 PRINT: sah~ah  after |
35 COUNT: ~ai 1 after |
36 GET_CLASS: ~aj D after |
37 GET_TYPE: ~ak object after |
38 STRLEN: ~al 3 after |
39 INIT_ARRAY (discarded): ~am after |
40 ADD_ARRAY_UNPACK: ~an 1 after |
41 FE_RESET_R / FE_FREE (array): body loop ~ao after |
42 FE_RESET_R (object): n p arr ~ap after |
43 FE_RESET_RW: body ~aq after |
44 RETURN: ~ar ar after |
45 YIELD: body g loop ~as after |
46 YIELD_FROM: body loop ~at after |
47 THROW: ~au catch after |
48 CLONE: ~av ~av av after |
49 FREE: ~aw after |
50 MATCH: ~ax hit after |
51 MATCH (subject object): ~ay other after ~ay0 |
52 SWITCH / CASE: ~az case after |
53 PRE_INC_OBJ: 2 after ~ba0 |
54 FETCH_LIST_R: set ~bb after |
55 CALLABLE_CONVERT: made bc ~bc after |
56 JMP_NULL (?->): ~bd bd after |
57 BEGIN_SILENCE: ~be be after |
58 VERIFY_RETURN_TYPE: ~bf after |
59 FUNC_GET_ARGS: ~bg 1 after |
60 FETCH_CLASS_NAME: ~bh D after |
61 FETCH_CLASS_CONSTANT: ~bi c after |
62 FETCH_STATIC_PROP_R: ~bj sp after |
63 FETCH_OBJ_W (nested): ~bl after |
64 PIPE: ~bm bm after |
65 NEW args: made ~sbn ~bn after |
66 ARRAY_KEY_EXISTS: ~bo y after |
67 IN_ARRAY: ~bp y after |
68 ASSIGN_OP (.=) expression: ~bq xsbq after |
69 ASSIGN_OP (.=) in place: ~br ~bs 5007 after |
70 ASSIGN_OP (.=) loop: ~bt0 ~bt1 ~bt2 sbt0sbt1sbt2 after |
end
